      {
        "id": "p11-q11-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the equation of the tangent to the curve $y=10^x$ at the point $(1,10)$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(10\\ln 10)x-y+10(1-\\ln 10)=0$.",
          "worked": "$$\\frac{dy}{dx}=10^x\\ln 10$$\nAt $(1,10)$, $m=10\\ln 10$.\n\nTangent:\n$$\\begin{align*}y-10&=(10\\ln 10)(x-1)\\\\(10\\ln 10)x-y+10(1-\\ln 10)&=0\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p11-q11-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Find the equation of the normal to the curve $y=5^x$ at the point $(2,25)$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x+25y\\ln 5-625\\ln 5-2=0$.",
          "worked": "$$\\frac{dy}{dx}=5^x\\ln 5$$\nAt $(2,25)$, the tangent gradient is $m=25\\ln 5$.\n\nNormal gradient $=-\\dfrac{1}{25\\ln 5}$.\n\nNormal:\n$$\\begin{align*}y-25&=\\left(-\\frac{1}{25\\ln 5}\\right)(x-2)\\\\25y\\ln 5-625\\ln 5&=-x+2\\\\x+25y\\ln 5-625\\ln 5-2&=0\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p11-q11-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "At what $x$ value are the tangents to $y=10^x$ and $y=5^x$ parallel? Answer to 3 s.f.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x\\approx-0.517$ (3 s.f.).",
          "worked": "Tangents are parallel when their gradients are equal:\n$$\\begin{align*}10^x\\ln 10&=5^x\\ln 5\\\\\\left(\\frac{10}{5}\\right)^x&=\\frac{\\ln 5}{\\ln 10}\\\\2^x&=\\frac{\\ln 5}{\\ln 10}\\\\2^x&=\\log_{10}5\\\\x&=\\log_2(\\log_{10}5)\\\\x&\\approx-0.517\\quad\\text{(3 s.f.)}\\end{align*}$$\nSupporting graph: https://www.desmos.com/calculator/ktu3r3zaby",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 43
      }
    ]
  },
